{"script":"s_0_3_0","des":"隐者与药田 接取步骤","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1","mirrow":false,"x":-120,"trans":true,"y":-474,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1e","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-120,"trans":true,"y":-474,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1e","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"隐者芭杜尔","text":"[show]你们好，契约者们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"隐者芭杜尔","text":"[show]这里的森林也还是这么美丽，每次站在这片土地上，就能感受到大自然的宁静与美好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"隐者芭杜尔","text":"[show]但这种美好是很脆弱的，我需要更加强大的力量保护自然。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"隐者芭杜尔","text":"[show]我最近在研究制药，但缺少某些原液。我现在需要在这里照顾苗圃，没有时间去寻找。你们可以为我带几瓶法力药水原液吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"隐者芭杜尔","text":"[show]万分感谢，我在这里等候你们的消息。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-120,"trans":true,"y":-474,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}